B.bt9=s(["Garbage disposal humming/stuck? Pressed the red reset button underneath the unit.","Active drip? Checked if the local under-sink angle stop valve can be turned clockwise.","Slow drain? Cleared visible hair/debris from the drain stopper."],t.s)
B.bvB=s(['Dead outlet in kitchen/bath? Pressed the "RESET" button on all GFCI outlets.',"Room power out? Checked the unit circuit breaker panel for a tripped switch.","Fixture out? Tested with a known working LED bulb."],t.s)
B.aKX=s(["Fridge not cooling? Verified temperature dial is set to 37\xb0F and vents are not blocked.","Dishwasher not draining? Checked bottom filter basket and air gap cap.","Washer/Dryer issue? Checked lint trap, door latch, and dedicated breaker."],t.s)
B.bwv=s(["Thermostat blank or unresponsive? Replaced AA/AAA batteries inside faceplate.","Weak airflow? Checked if the return air filter needs replacement.","Verified thermostat mode is set to AUTO (not FAN ON) and target temp is set."],t.s)
B.bpo=s(["Smart lock/keypad slow? Checked if low-battery beep or indicator flashes.","Deadbolt sticking? Tested locking with door pulled firmly against weatherstripping."],t.s)
B.byk=s(["Window or balcony draft/leak? Checked that sash lock is fullylatched and track drain is clear.","Exterior light out? Checked interior wall switch or photocell sensor."],t.s)
